#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up your local environment by following along with the [Get "
"started](/guides/) guide in our documentation page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Configure seu ambiente local seguindo o guia [Primeiros passos](/guides/) na"
